This is an unofficial third-party Electron wrapper for the Lumo web app
(https://lumo.proton.me), Proton's private AI assistant. It is not
endorsed by or affiliated with Proton AG. "Proton" and "Lumo" are
trademarks of Proton AG.

This project bundles no Proton code or assets other than the icon in
icons/icon.png, which is a copy of Proton's own publicly served PWA icon
(https://lumo.proton.me/assets/android-chrome-512x512.png). It only
loads the Lumo web app in an Electron window at runtime. Your use of
Lumo remains subject to Proton's own Terms of Service.
